@startuml authorization-eidas-sequence
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false

participant App
participant "FHIR Server\n(Resource Server)" as FHIR
participant "Authorization Server" as AS
participant "eIDAS / EUDI Wallet" as eIDAS

== Discover ==

App -> FHIR: Discover SMART configuration
FHIR --> App: SMART configuration

== Get Access Token ==

alt Pre-authorized Backend Service
    App -> AS: Token request\n(client_credentials, private_key_jwt)
    AS --> App: Access token
else Interactive user or patient launch
    App -> AS: Authorization request\n(authorization code + PKCE)
    AS -> eIDAS: Authenticate user when required\nby the environment
    eIDAS --> AS: Authentication result / presentation
    note right of AS
        Validate result
        Establish user session
        Apply authorization policy
    end note
    AS --> App: Redirect with authorization code
    App -> AS: Token request\n(code, PKCE verifier, client authentication as applicable)
    AS --> App: Access token and applicable launch context
end

== Access Content ==

App -> FHIR: Protected resource request (access token)
FHIR --> App: Authorized response

@enduml